  "<size=20>GO GO WOOF WOOF RU! <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Requirement: Runa has [Warm Welcome] or [Furious Pursuit]\\nWhen Runa has [Warm Welcome] or [Furious Pursuit], trigger their corresponding effect, only 1 effect can be activated at a time.\\n[Warm Welcome]: Deal Fire Follow Up damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, increase the target's DMG Taken based on $2 own Ailment ACC, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>, increase their Fire Elec Ice Wind DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> for $5 turns.\\n[Furious Pursuit]: Deal Fire Follow Up damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> of ATK, increase the target's DMG Taken based on $7 own Ailment ACC, up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color>, increase their Follow Up DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$9</color> for $10 turns.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Shichi-kun will hunt you down to the ends of the earth for destroying Shibuya!</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, permanently inflict $2 [Big Bad] stacks on foes. Stacks up to $6 times. [Big Bad]: When any foe takes Fire, Ice, Elec, or Wind skill damage or Follow Up damage, spend $3 [Big Bad] stack, and increase the damage by $4 of Runa's Ailment ACC (up to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>). If Runa's skills activate this effect, [Big Bad] will not be spent.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Fire damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
