  "Stay with Me Forever": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain [Warm Welcome] and [Furious Pursuit]; Extend the debuff from [Fiery Handshake], [Intimidate Baddie], and [GO GO WOOF WOOF RU!] by $1 turn. When Runa has both [Warm Welcome] and [Furious Pursuit], [GO GO WOOF WOOF RU!] will increase all foes' Fire, Elec, Ice, and Wind DMG Taken by $2, increase the main target's Follow Up DMG Taken by $3, trigger both the effects of [Warm Welcome] and [Furious Pursuit]. (Cannot stack the DMG Taken effect from [Warm Welcome] and [Furious Pursuit], take the highest value when triggering both effects.)": "",
