  "When Runa has [Warm Welcome] or [Furious Pursuit], trigger their corresponding effect.\\n[Warm Welcome]: Deal Fire Follow Up damage to <color=#FFFF00>all foes</color> equal to $1 of ATK, increase the target's DMG Taken based on $2 own Ailment ACC, up to $3, increase their Fire Elec Ice Wind DMG Taken by $4 for $5 turns.\\n[Furious Pursuit]: Deal Fire Follow Up damage to <color=#FFFF00>1 foe</color> equal to $6 of ATK, increase the main target's DMG Taken based on $7 own Ailment ACC, up to $8, increase their Follow Up DMG Taken by $9 for $10 turns.": "",
