  "r:\"Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\.\\nDecrease target's Defense by (.+?)% of {{A}}'s ailment accuracy for (\\d+) turns \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\. Also, when the target of this effect takes Fire, Ice, Electric, or Wind skill damage, decrease Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> more\\. The Defense decrease effects from this skill and Furrious Bark do not stack\\.\\nAlso, (\\d+)% chance to inflict Burn on the target, and gain Big Welcome for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\.\\nDecrease target's Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> \\+ (.+?)% of {{A}}'s ailment accuracy \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\. The Defense decrease effects from this skill and Welcome Hug do not stack\\.\\nAlso, gain Furrocious Follow-Up for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Usable when Big Welcome or Furrocious Follow-Up are active, and activates various effects based on which is active\\. If both effects are active at the same time, prioritize Big Welcome\\.\\nRemove Big Welcome and Furrocious Follow-Up after effect activates\\.\\nBig Welcome: Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. This skill's damage is counted as a <link\\=(.+?)><u>Resonance</u></link>\\.\\nIncrease target's damage taken by (\\d+)% of {{A}}'s ailment accuracy \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\), and Fire, Ice, Electric and Wind damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nFurrocious Follow-Up: Deal Fire damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. This skill's damage is counted as a Resonance\\.\\nIncrease target's damage taken by (.+?)% of {{A}}'s ailment accuracy \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\), and Resonance damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\.\\nPermanently inflict (\\d+) Enthusiastic Fuse stacks on foes\\. Stacks up to (\\d+) times \\(remove as wave progresses\\)\\.\\nEnthusiastic Fuse: When any foe takes Fire, Ice, Electric, or Wind skill damage or <link\\=(.+?)><u>Resonance</u></link> damage, spend (\\d+) Enthusiastic Fuse stack, and increase the damage by (.+?)% of {{A}}'s ailment accuracy \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\. If {{A}}'s skills and Resonance activate this effect, Enthusiastic Fuse will not be spent\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Fire damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"During battle, increase {{A}}'s Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of her ailment accuracy\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When {{A}} inflicts a debuff on a foe with a skill, increase her Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turn\\. When an ally deals Fire, Ice, Electric or Wind damage or <link\\=(.+?)><u>Resonance</u></link> damage, grant them the same Attack increase effect\\.\"": "",
  "When Big Welcome or Furrocious Follow-Up are active, Runa can use Woof Woof Blaze.\\nWhen using Woof Woof Blaze, 60% chance to decrease target's healing received by 30%/40%/50%, and Defense by 6%/12%/18% (effect changes at Lv. 1/50/70, respectively) for 2 turns.": "",
  "After using Woof Woof Blaze and activating the effects of Big Welcome, increase target's Fire, Ice, Electric and Wind damage taken by 36% for 2 turns. When activating the effects of Furrocious Follow-Up, increase target's <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Resonance</u></link> damage taken by 50% for 2 turns.": "",
  "When a foe has a debuff inflicted by Runa, increase target's critical damage taken by 36%, and decrease healing received by 20%.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Welcome Hug and Furrious Bark by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase number of Enthusiastic Fuse stacks inflicted on foes to 4, and increase the maximum number of stacks to 4.": "",
